This repository (scripts, Nastran input decks, meshes, CAD files, results, figures, reports and the raw solver output
attached to its releases) is published so that the examining committee and other readers can view it and re-run the
simulation for review.

No other use is permitted without the prior written permission of the copyright holders. This includes copying,
modifying, redistributing, publishing, or using any part in other work.

The patient knee-angle and knee-moment data were digitised from Büttner et al., J. Orthop. Res. 43(2):322-336, 2025,
doi:10.1002/jor.26001. That source remains under the terms of its publisher.

THE CONTENT IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. It is an idealised engineering reference, not a validated
model of a medical device, and must not be used for clinical decisions.
